WEBVTT

00:06:59.748 --> 00:07:02.001
designed for and by women,

00:07:02.042 --> 00:07:04.253
when I was left without
a footwear sponsor.

00:07:04.253 --> 00:07:09.800
Because I was tired of not being valued
or able to show up fully as myself.

00:07:10.259 --> 00:07:12.678
I learned that my voice has power,

00:07:12.678 --> 00:07:15.598
and when I bet on myself,
change is possible.

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:17.558
During the pandemic,

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:20.019
we all saw what happens
when that thin line

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:23.898
between our professional
and personal lives permanently blurs.

00:07:23.939 --> 00:07:27.651
We have seen women step back,
give up, drop out,

00:07:27.693 --> 00:07:30.196
as having it all became doing it all,